      "Best for": "Dessert-style shakes"
    },
    "amazonUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SF8XD1V"
  },
  {
    "id": "pescience-select-protein-chocolate-truffle",
    "name": "PEScience Select Protein, Chocolate Truffle",
    "brand": "PEScience",
    "badge": "Best Chocolate",
    "category": "Milk protein isolate and whey blend",
    "description": "Chocolate Truffle is the richer of the Select chocolate options. Per retailer labels at the time of writing, a 33 g scoop delivers 23 g of protein in about 125 calories, slightly less protein per scoop than vanilla because cocoa takes up some of the weight. It is the pick for chocolate shakes, mocha drinks and chocolate protein baking.",
    "pros": [
      "23 g of protein per scoop",
