      "Best for": "Chocolate shakes and mochas"
    },
    "amazonUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPTM62WZ"
  },
  {
    "id": "pescience-select-vegan-protein",
    "name": "PEScience Select Vegan Protein, Chocolate Bliss",
    "brand": "PEScience",
    "badge": "Best Dairy-Free",
    "category": "Pea and brown rice protein blend",
    "description": "Select Vegan blends pea and brown rice protein concentrates for about 20 g of protein per scoop, with roughly 110 calories for Chocolate Bliss, per retailer labels at the time of writing. It is sweetened only with stevia and is free of dairy, soy and gluten. Sodium is relatively high, and some buyers report a chalky texture and stevia aftertaste.",
    "pros": [
      "Dairy-free, soy-free and gluten-free",
      "Stevia only, no sucralose",
      "Pea and rice pairing for a rounder amino profile"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "About 20 g per scoop",
      "Sodium around 290-330 mg per scoop",
      "Mixed texture reviews"
